 *                            open).
 *   - dock/adaptive-legibility.css — the darken-over-light self-engage (the
 *                            continuous backdrop-luma tint clamp, the warm-chromatic
 *                            dock ink, the @container light bucket, contrast-color()
 *                            refinement, the frozen-backdrop static arm). Split from
 *                            morph.css to keep both partials under the 500-line bound.
 * - dock/density.css — the density × --dock-scale cascade.
 *   - dock/layers.css      — the `.dock-layer` crossfade + hit-test + reveal-
 *                            stagger contract + the `layout="grid"` tile grid.
 *   - dock/layer-group.css — `.dock-layer-group` / layer switcher / stack.
 *   - dock/overflow.css    — the `overflow=` scroll/wrap strategies + the coarse
 *                            multiplier.
