 * The FIVE interactive control families stay in dock-controls.css (@import-ed
 * by index.css directly after this file). The Vue SFCs own
 * structure + runtime behavior; selectors, motion, glass, and layering tokens
 * live here + in the partials so consumers have one public CSS path. */

