   under the no-god-module 500-line bound. @import-ed IMMEDIATELY
   AFTER dock/shell.css and BEFORE dock/morph.css, in the SAME @layer components — the
   persistent-region block was the tail of shell.css (disjoint selectors), so the carve
   is isomorphic (same layer, same source order → ZERO visual delta). */
