/* [2026-08-24 · BK #47 W3 LATTICE] `overflow.css` → `run.css`, in the same slot and
   the same `@layer`, so the cascade position is byte-unchanged. The partial answered
   "does the row fit?" with a ResizeObserver, an attribute and two branches; the
   lattice answers it with the platform. Its ONE unrelated tenant — the coarse-pointer
   scale register — moved to `density.css`, whose cascade it belongs in, with the ×1.17
