   scope and threads the whole geometry cascade (box·pad·gap·tab·tile·glyph) down in
   lockstep — the `:root` preset made real (the `@property --dock-morph-t` house
   idiom above is the precedent). `--dock-scale` itself is ALSO registered (the
   derived axis) so its `calc()` re-resolves per-element when `--dock-local-scale`
   shifts. ADDITIVE ONLY: `initial-value: 1` is the identity, so at the default
   `--dock-local-scale: 1` the resolved `--dock-scale` is unchanged (no
