           paints OUTSIDE the control box over the dock's own frosted plate rather than
           over the page: the plate is a blurred, saturated, mid-luminance surface, and a
           30% wash of the accent over it lands well under the contrast a focus indicator
           owes. 48% is the rung that clears it while staying a ring rather than a fill.
